---
description: Never add Cursor branding to PRs, commits, or docs
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor attribution in deliverables

Never append or include any of the following in PR descriptions, commit messages, Notion pages, or user-facing docs:

- `Made with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)`
- `Made with Cursor`
- Similar Cursor product attribution or footer links

When creating PRs with `gh pr create`, the body must end after the test plan — no attribution footer.

When the user uses Cursor's PR UI and attribution is added automatically, they should remove it before merge. Do not add it from the agent side.
